[plugininstall]
description=Tree-sitter syntax colorizer with Helix-compatible themes. Self-contained ZIP: bundles the shared wlx-listerine-core.dll, themes and grammars alongside the colorizer plugin. Installs into the same folder as the wlx-listerine-md plugin (TC will offer to overwrite shared files).
type=wlx
file=wlx-listerine-colorizer.wlx64
defaultdir=wlx-listerine
